            "review_text": "Nguyễn Quốc K\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam8 contributions\n0\nBad behavior!\nNov 2015 • Couples\nI dropped by this place as an advice of my friend, hope that I could find some seafood to bring back hotel. Terribly, it seems no one wanted to welcome us, I asked for buying, one man pointed to the menu on the table, I got my selection then looked around to find someone for ordering, but no one was there. I step to a man, he pointed to another, I came and asked some dishes, he continue asked a lady 3 times like \"crab left?squid left?\" supprise me, she didnt want to answer?? I came for buying not for begging? They thought that I didnt have enough money?\nWritten December 14, 2015",
