            "review_title": "Review at Thanh Phat",
            "review_text": "Ricky L\nSingapore, Singapore224 contributions\n0\nThanh Phat for inexpensive lunch\nSep 2015 • Friends\nHad lunch here with friends. Away from tourist area. It was Thanh Phat II that we went to.\n\nSelect the seafood you want from the tank. Ask about the price first. English speaking there is zero. LoL. Use finger to point and a calculator to cfm price.\n\nBest to eat are the Soldier Crab which is surprisingly meaty and steamed Grouper (20SGD) which is fresh.\n\nMy Tiger Crystal beer tasted gassy and good.\n\nGood view of fishing boats and day-to-day vietnamese fishermen life.\n\nDidnt want to complain about the sitting area itself as I have already expected it this way. :)\nRead more\nWritten September 26, 2015",
